window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/comm-v28-161-0aae998de5a34bdc.json"]={sha256:"0aae998de5a34bdc210e9b054e8be769d95c69a45e396a216e4cbce7563e4e0d",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v28-case-d6dc9bf4ae890c63","url":"https://www.itu.int/rec/T-REC-G.984.2/en","title":"ITU-T G.984.2: GPON physical media dependent layer","titleEn":"ITU-T G.984.2: GPON physical media dependent layer","publisher":"ITU-T","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"comm-v28-161","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"comm-v28-161","related":[{"id":"comm-v28-162","referenceUrls":["https://www.itu.int/rec/T-REC-G.984.3/en"],"title":"GPON DBA：保證頻寬與剩餘授權","titleEn":"GPON DBA: assured bandwidth and residual grants","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：由另一學徒只使用交付檔案重建兩情境與判定；需同時保留未通過情境。 教學剩餘裕度至少0 dB；32分光可行，64分光略負且不可藉四捨五入通過。 pon_branches.csv與最差支路功率表 保留輸入、逐項中間值、名義 2.9485 與變更 -0.0617997 dB、反例、驗收判定與模型限制，供另一學徒從零重算。 附離線證據實驗：python3 tools/curriculum-v28/labs-optical.py --lab comm-v28-161 --out ./comm-v28-161-evidence；輸出目錄必須尚不存在。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: A second apprentice must reconstruct both scenarios and decisions using only the handover files; retain failing cases as well. Teaching remaining margin must be nonnegative:32-way split passes,64-way is slightly negative and cannot pass by rounding. pon_branches.csv and worst-branch power table Preserve inputs, intermediate values, nominal 2.9485 and changed -0.0617997 dB, counterexamples, acceptance decisions and model limits so another apprentice can reproduce them. Offline evidence lab: python3 tools/curriculum-v28/labs-optical.py --lab comm-v28-161 --out ./comm-v28-161-evidence; the output directory must not already exist.","difference":"完成兩組條件的可重算判定，指出哪些觀察能區分原因。 教學保證量需全部保留且額外分配守恆；不能把1500/3000當整個ONU的總授權。","differenceEn":"Produce reproducible decisions for both configurations and identify observations that discriminate causes. Preserve every assured allocation and conserve excess;1500/3000 are excess grants, not total ONU grants.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["合成可用預算28 dB，固定纖路8 dB、超額2 dB；分光N=32改64。 名義式 28-8-2-10*log10(32) = 2.9485 dB；變更式 28-8-2-10*log10(64) = -0.0617997 dB。逐項標示量綱，先代入未四捨五入數值再作比較。 手算名義式並保存所有中間項，實作下列獨立驗證而非只抄最終數字： 以功率均分為1/N再轉dB核對；逐支路列不平衡損耗，不能把平均裕度當最差支路。","合成輪容量10000 bytes，4個ONU各保證1000；其餘6000等分給4個有需求ONU；變更只有2個有額外需求。 名義式 (10000-4*1000)/4 = 1500 extra bytes per active ONU；變更式 (10000-4*1000)/2 = 3000 extra bytes per active ONU。逐項標示量綱，先代入未四捨五入數值再作比較。 手算名義式並保存所有中間項，實作下列獨立驗證而非只抄最終數字： 建立每ONU需求/保證/額外/總授權表，逐欄求和不超10000；零需求ONU不得拿走額外額度。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Synthetic allowance28 dB, fixed path8 dB and excess2 dB; change split ratio from32 to64. Nominal 28-8-2-10*log10(32) = 2.9485 dB; changed 28-8-2-10*log10(64) = -0.0617997 dB. Label dimensions, substitute unrounded values and only then compare. Calculate the nominal expression with intermediate terms and implement this independent validation rather than copying the final number: Divide power byN and convert to dB; retain per-branch imbalance instead of using mean margin as the worst branch.","Synthetic cycle capacity10000 bytes with four1000-byte assured grants; divide6000 excess equally among4, then2, active excess-demand ONUs. Nominal (10000-4*1000)/4 = 1500 extra bytes per active ONU; changed (10000-4*1000)/2 = 3000 extra bytes per active ONU. Label dimensions, substitute unrounded values and only then compare. Calculate the nominal expression with intermediate terms and implement this independent validation rather than copying the final number: Tabulate demand, assurance, excess and total grant per ONU; sum to at most10000 and give no excess to zero-demand ONUs.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"comm-v28-171","referenceUrls":["https://www.nokia.com/bell-labs/publications-and-media/publications/tat-8-the-first-transatlantic-optical-system/"],"title":"TAT-8：海纜再生區段與設備數量","titleEn":"TAT-8: submarine regeneration spans and equipment count","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：由另一學徒只使用交付檔案重建兩情境與判定；需同時保留未通過情境。 教學剩餘裕度至少0 dB；32分光可行，64分光略負且不可藉四捨五入通過。 pon_branches.csv與最差支路功率表 保留輸入、逐項中間值、名義 2.9485 與變更 -0.0617997 dB、反例、驗收判定與模型限制，供另一學徒從零重算。 附離線證據實驗：python3 tools/curriculum-v28/labs-optical.py --lab comm-v28-161 --out ./comm-v28-161-evidence；輸出目錄必須尚不存在。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: A second apprentice must reconstruct both scenarios and decisions using only the handover files; retain failing cases as well. Teaching remaining margin must be nonnegative:32-way split passes,64-way is slightly negative and cannot pass by rounding. pon_branches.csv and worst-branch power table Preserve inputs, intermediate values, nominal 2.9485 and changed -0.0617997 dB, counterexamples, acceptance decisions and model limits so another apprentice can reproduce them. Offline evidence lab: python3 tools/curriculum-v28/labs-optical.py --lab comm-v28-161 --out ./comm-v28-161-evidence; the output directory must not already exist.","difference":"完成兩組條件的可重算判定，指出哪些觀察能區分原因。 每一區段均不得超過假設上限，端點恰有兩個；數量減少不等於已證明供電、OSNR或可靠度合格。","differenceEn":"Produce reproducible decisions for both configurations and identify observations that discriminate causes. Every span must satisfy its assumed limit and there must be exactly two shore endpoints; fewer units do not establish power-feed, OSNR or reliability compliance.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["合成可用預算28 dB，固定纖路8 dB、超額2 dB；分光N=32改64。 名義式 28-8-2-10*log10(32) = 2.9485 dB；變更式 28-8-2-10*log10(64) = -0.0617997 dB。逐項標示量綱，先代入未四捨五入數值再作比較。 手算名義式並保存所有中間項，實作下列獨立驗證而非只抄最終數字： 以功率均分為1/N再轉dB核對；逐支路列不平衡損耗，不能把平均裕度當最差支路。","合成線路6200 km，區段上限50 km；比較上限60 km，採均勻配置。 名義式 ceil(6200/50)-1 = 123 units；變更式 ceil(6200/60)-1 = 103 units。逐項標示量綱，先代入未四捨五入數值再作比較。 手算名義式並保存所有中間項，實作下列獨立驗證而非只抄最終數字： 用設備數加一反推平均區段長，再逐段加總到6200 km；103台時104區段約59.615 km。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Synthetic allowance28 dB, fixed path8 dB and excess2 dB; change split ratio from32 to64. Nominal 28-8-2-10*log10(32) = 2.9485 dB; changed 28-8-2-10*log10(64) = -0.0617997 dB. Label dimensions, substitute unrounded values and only then compare. Calculate the nominal expression with intermediate terms and implement this independent validation rather than copying the final number: Divide power byN and convert to dB; retain per-branch imbalance instead of using mean margin as the worst branch.","Synthetic6200 km route, maximum span50 km; compare60 km with uniform placement. Nominal ceil(6200/50)-1 = 123 units; changed ceil(6200/60)-1 = 103 units. Label dimensions, substitute unrounded values and only then compare. Calculate the nominal expression with intermediate terms and implement this independent validation rather than copying the final number: Recover mean span from units plus one, then sum all spans to6200 km;103 internal units imply104 spans of about59.615 km.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v28-case-d30e23afc3081aad","url":"https://www.itu.int/rec/T-REC-G.984.3/en","title":"ITU-T G.984.3: GPON transmission convergence layer","titleEn":"ITU-T G.984.3: GPON transmission convergence layer","publisher":"ITU-T","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v28-case-b750a1a1f17d5275","url":"https://www.nokia.com/bell-labs/publications-and-media/publications/tat-8-the-first-transatlantic-optical-system/","title":"TAT-8: The First Transatlantic Optical System","titleEn":"TAT-8: The First Transatlantic Optical System","publisher":"Nokia Bell Labs","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
